msgid "A120_M48A5_hound_TLXXL"
msgstr "Thunderbolt"

msgid "A120_M48A5_hound_TLXXL_descr"
msgstr ""
"The good old Thunderbolt—grumpy and loud—still roars like it owns the "
"battlefield. Its heart? A power unit designed by von Krieger himself. And "
"now again, I get to return the favor—using his own genius to crack open his "
"precious machines. Say what you want about the man, but this engine? "
"Timeless. Still ticks like a watch. In this warped battlefield, where time "
"twists and repeats, I’ll trust this beast. Let’s see how Krieger likes the "
"sound of his past blowing holes in his present."

msgid "A120_M48A5_hound_TLXXL_short"
msgstr "Thunderbolt"

msgid "A120_M48A5_hound_TLXXL_short_special"
msgstr "Major modernization of the main battle tank"

